@startuml Synchronization
title Synchronization - State Diagram

[*] --> Idle : Initial state

Idle --> Syncing : Trigger sync
Syncing --> FetchingRemote : Request remote changes
FetchingRemote --> FetchingLocal : Receive remote data
FetchingLocal --> Resolving : Collect local changes

Resolving --> Merging : No conflicts
Resolving --> ConflictDetected : Conflicts found

ConflictDetected --> AutoResolved : Auto-resolution possible
ConflictDetected --> ManualResolution : User intervention needed

ManualResolution --> Merging : User resolves
AutoResolved --> Merging : Merge applied

Merging --> Pushing : Push merged changes
Pushing --> UpdatingIndex : Remote updated
UpdatingIndex --> Idle : Sync complete

Syncing --> SyncFailed : Network error
SyncFailed --> Idle : Retry
SyncFailed --> Idle : Cancel

@enduml
